{"seq":3,"slug":"install-quality-complaint-claim","title":"安装质量投诉、返工理赔与安全事件闭环","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-installation-assembly-field-service/completion-aftersales/install-quality-complaint-claim","wordCount":2808,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"安装质量投诉-返工理赔与安全事件闭环\">安装质量投诉、返工理赔与安全事件闭环</h1><p>一台洗碗机装完三天后客户报「底部渗水」，技师二次上门发现进水管接口未按扭矩拧紧；同一周，另一个城市的技师装吊柜时从人字梯摔下、手腕骨裂。这两件事走的是<strong>完全不同的两条闭环</strong>：前者是<strong>质量投诉 → 责任判定 → 返工 → 理赔扣款</strong>，后者是<strong>安全事件 → 人员救治 → 监管上报 → 根因整改</strong>。把两者塞进同一张「售后工单」表是结构性错误——理赔要算钱、要对抗、要有举证时效；安全事件要抢时间、按法定时限上报，不能因「先谈赔付」而错过窗口。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-三类事件共用一份证据-却走三条时钟\">核心概念：三类事件共用一份证据，却走三条时钟</h2><p>上门安装产生的负面后果，按<strong>后果类型</strong>而非「是否客户投诉」分三类，每类的驱动力、时钟、终局完全不同：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>质量投诉（quality complaint）</strong>：结果未达约定标准，但未造成人身或财产损失。驱动是履约 SLA 与满意度，处置是返工（rework）。</li>\n<li><strong>安装损坏与财产损失（installation damage）</strong>：作业中损坏客户物品或房屋（打穿水管、划伤地板、碎裂台面）。驱动是赔偿与保险，处置是定损。</li>\n<li><strong>安全事件（safety incident）</strong>：造成人员受伤、或存在可致伤隐患（违反电气/燃器/高空作业规范）。驱动是法定上报义务，处置是隔离与根因整改。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>三类的共同点是<strong>都依赖同一份现场证据链</strong>（<a href=\"../field-execution-delivery/field-workorder-state-evidence\">现场工单状态机与作业证据留痕模型</a>：完工照、BOM 消耗确认、客户签名、GPS/时间戳）。差别在证据的<strong>用途</strong>：质量投诉用它做责任归属对抗，安全事件用它做事故重建与监管举证。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[负面后果发生] --&gt; B{造成人身伤害&lt;br/&gt;或致伤隐患?}&#10;  B --&gt;|是| C[安全事件通道&lt;br/&gt;隔离 → 法定上报 → 根因整改]&#10;  B --&gt;|否| D{损坏客户财产?}&#10;  D --&gt;|是| E[定损赔偿通道&lt;br/&gt;定损 → 保险/供应商赔付]&#10;  D --&gt;|否| F[质量投诉通道&lt;br/&gt;受理 → 判定 → 返工 → 扣款]&#10;  C --&gt; G[闭环: 复检验证 + 度量归档]&#10;  E --&gt; G&#10;  F --&gt; G\">graph TD\n  A[负面后果发生] --&gt; B{造成人身伤害&lt;br/&gt;或致伤隐患?}\n  B --&gt;|是| C[安全事件通道&lt;br/&gt;隔离 → 法定上报 → 根因整改]\n  B --&gt;|否| D{损坏客户财产?}\n  D --&gt;|是| E[定损赔偿通道&lt;br/&gt;定损 → 保险/供应商赔付]\n  D --&gt;|否| F[质量投诉通道&lt;br/&gt;受理 → 判定 → 返工 → 扣款]\n  C --&gt; G[闭环: 复检验证 + 度量归档]\n  E --&gt; G\n  F --&gt; G</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>质量投诉</th>\n<th>财产损坏</th>\n<th>安全事件</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>首要时钟</td>\n<td>响应时限（常见 24h）</td>\n<td>定损时限（常见 72h）</td>\n<td>法定上报（8h/24h）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>是否可协商</td>\n<td>可，责任可对抗</td>\n<td>可，金额可谈</td>\n<td>不可，上报义务刚性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主要数据</td>\n<td>完工证据、BOM</td>\n<td>定损报告、影像</td>\n<td>事故时间线、伤情记录</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>终局动作</td>\n<td>返工 + 扣款</td>\n<td>赔付 + 保险追偿</td>\n<td>整改 + 复训 + 复检</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>失败代价</td>\n<td>SLA 罚金、差评</td>\n<td>赔付成本、诉讼</td>\n<td>罚款、刑责、平台下架</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"责任归属判定-用举证结构而不是客服话术\">责任归属判定：用举证结构而不是客服话术</h2><p>理赔的第一性原则是：<strong>谁能提供反证，谁就承担举证不能的后果</strong>。安装服务的取证优势天然在服务方（技师在场、有影像、有 BOM 记录），因此判定规则通常是「<strong>默认服务方先行担责，除非服务方举证推翻</strong>」——把对抗成本从客户转移给专业方，也正是各国消费品安全法的取向。</p>\n<p>判定所需的四组证据缺一即无法收敛：<strong>基线证据</strong>（进场照：客户物品、墙面、地面、已有管线状态——没有它，「这划痕是原有的」永远争论不清）；<strong>过程证据</strong>（关键步骤照，如水管接口、电气接线、膨胀螺栓，外加 BOM 消耗与工具记录）；<strong>验收证据</strong>（客户签字或电子签名，含验收条款与时间戳）；<strong>规范依据</strong>（是否按厂商安装手册执行——品牌方常在保修条款中把「非授权/非合规安装」列为免责）。</p>\n<p>责任分为四类，落点决定钱从谁的账上出：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>责任方</th>\n<th>典型情形</th>\n<th>成本承担</th>\n<th>系统动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>技师／服务商</td>\n<td>扭矩不足、密封圈漏装、打孔偏位</td>\n<td>100% 返工成本 + 违约金</td>\n<td>扣款、计入服务商评分</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>品牌方／产品缺陷</td>\n<td>批量化接口设计缺陷、随机装配不良</td>\n<td>品牌方，含换机</td>\n<td>转保修工单、触发批次排查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>客户使用不当</td>\n<td>擅自改动、超载使用、未按说明保养</td>\n<td>客户承担，付费返工</td>\n<td>出报价单、确认后执行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>平台／流程缺陷</td>\n<td>派单错型号、BOM 缺件仍派工</td>\n<td>平台承担</td>\n<td>流程整改、不扣服务商</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>判定必须在<strong>举证窗口</strong>内完成（行业常见做法是受理后 7 个自然日）：证据时效性强，拖久了影像丢失、客户记忆模糊、技师离职，判定成本指数上升。这与<a href=\"../appointment-technician-dispatch/reschedule-noshow-candidate-queue\">改约、爽约与候选队列</a>的时效逻辑同源——<strong>任何依赖现实瞬时事实的判定，都必须有显式截止时钟</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"返工理赔的成本计量与扣款模型\">返工理赔的成本计量与扣款模型</h2><p>返工不是「再上一次门」那么简单，它是可计量、可对账、可作为服务商绩效罚项的一笔成本，由五项构成：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>rework</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>labor</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>parts</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>travel</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>goodwill</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>penalty</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{rework}} = C_{\\text{labor}} + C_{\\text{parts}} + C_{\\text{travel}} + C_{\\text{goodwill}} + C_{\\text{penalty}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">rework</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">labor</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">parts</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">travel</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">goodwill</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">penalty</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>labor</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{labor}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">labor</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是人工（从排班状态机里实际工时求和），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>parts</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{parts}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">parts</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是补件与损耗，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>travel</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{travel}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">travel</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是二次上门路程成本（距离 × 单价），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>goodwill</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{goodwill}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">goodwill</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是客户安抚成本（折扣券、延保、赠品），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>penalty</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{penalty}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">penalty</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是违约罚金。罚金有两种形态：<strong>SLA 违约罚</strong>（未在承诺窗口内完成）与<strong>重复上门罚</strong>（第 N 次上门按率追加）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>penalty</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>sla</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mn mathvariant=\"double-struck\">1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>超时</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>+</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{penalty}} = r_{\\text{sla}} \\cdot \\mathbb{1}[\\text{超时}] + \\sum_{k=2}^{n} r_{k} \\cdot w_{k}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">penalty</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">sla</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">超时</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9535em;vertical-align:-1.3021em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3021em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 次上门的罚率（通常递增），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是当次上门的基础工时权重。递增罚率的意义：第一次返工可能是偶发，第三次几乎必然指向流程或培训缺陷，罚款要反映这个非线性。</p>\n<p>财务上，这类扣款在平台与供应商之间通常以**费用抵扣（offset / chargeback）**而非独立收款结算——即在服务商的应付结算单里直接减项。这与跨境贸易中供应商质量扣款（SCAR / 8D 闭环、debit note）是同一套财务动作，只是触发源从「来料不良」换成「现场安装不良」。</p>\n<p>对服务商的返工要按<strong>故障模式</strong>归档，而非「客户不满意」这种笼统标签。归档到具体模式（接口渗漏、密封失效、走线不合规、孔位偏移、附件漏装）才能在季度复盘中定位培训或工具缺口。这构成与<a href=\"../field-execution-delivery/parts-tools-mobile-inventory\">备件与工具移动库存</a>的强耦合：缺件导致的二次上门统计上是「返工」，根因却在派工前的 BOM 校验，扣款应落在调度侧而非技师侧。</p>\n<h2 id=\"安全事件闭环-法定上报时钟优先于商业处置\">安全事件闭环：法定上报时钟优先于商业处置</h2><p>安全事件的处置顺序<strong>不能是「先谈赔付」</strong>。一旦涉及人身伤害或可致伤隐患，第一动作是现场隔离与人员救治，第二动作是按<strong>法定时限</strong>向监管报告，商业赔付排在后面。美国 OSHA 的记录与上报规则是理解这个时钟的教科书：雇主须在<strong>员工死亡 8 小时内</strong>、<strong>住院治疗／截肢／失明 24 小时内</strong>报告（29 CFR 1904.39）。错过窗口本身即独立违法，与事故责任无关。</p>\n<p>产品安全侧的法定通道更宽：美国 CPSC 要求制造商、进口商、分销商在获知「产品存在可致严重伤害或死亡缺陷、或不符自愿标准」后**立即（通常 24 小时内）**报告（15 U.S.C. §2064(b)、16 CFR Part 1115）；欧盟自 2024 年 12 月 13 日起适用《通用产品安全条例》(EU) 2023/988（取代 GPSD 2001/95/EC），要求经营者经 Safety Business Gateway 上报事故与伤害信息。<strong>一次安装导致的产品事故，可能同时触发劳动安全与产品安全两条上报线</strong>。</p>\n<p>安全事件的闭环状态机：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[事件发生] --&gt; B[现场止血: 救治/断源/隔离]&#10;  B --&gt; C{人员伤亡?}&#10;  C --&gt;|死亡| D[8h 内报 OSHA]&#10;  C --&gt;|住院/截肢/失明| E[24h 内报 OSHA]&#10;  C --&gt;|无伤亡但产品相关| F[评估 CPSC/GPSR 上报]&#10;  D --&gt; G[时间线重建 + 根因分析]&#10;  E --&gt; G&#10;  F --&gt; G&#10;  G --&gt; H[整改: 复训/装备/流程/产品]&#10;  H --&gt; I[现场复检验证]&#10;  I --&gt; J[闭环归档 + 知识库更新]\">graph TD\n  A[事件发生] --&gt; B[现场止血: 救治/断源/隔离]\n  B --&gt; C{人员伤亡?}\n  C --&gt;|死亡| D[8h 内报 OSHA]\n  C --&gt;|住院/截肢/失明| E[24h 内报 OSHA]\n  C --&gt;|无伤亡但产品相关| F[评估 CPSC/GPSR 上报]\n  D --&gt; G[时间线重建 + 根因分析]\n  E --&gt; G\n  F --&gt; G\n  G --&gt; H[整改: 复训/装备/流程/产品]\n  H --&gt; I[现场复检验证]\n  I --&gt; J[闭环归档 + 知识库更新]</pre><p>高空与电气是安装现场两大高危类别，规范现成。美国建筑业坠落防护门槛是 <strong>6 英尺（约 1.8 米）</strong>（OSHA 29 CFR 1926.501(b)(1)）；高空作业平台受 29 CFR 1926.453 约束；检修的锁定/挂牌（LOTO）依 29 CFR 1910.147。家电与暖通的质量侧有 ANSI/ACCA 5 QI HVAC Quality Installation Specification 与 ASHRAE Standard 180-2018 作「安装合规」判定依据。这些外部规范是责任判定锚点——不能只依赖内部标准，因为内部标准在监管调查中可被推翻。</p>\n<h2 id=\"运营度量与闭环质量门\">运营度量与闭环质量门</h2><p>三条闭环最终要收敛为<strong>可监控的度量</strong>，否则整改会退化为个案处理。度量按「率」而非「量」定义，便于跨地区、跨服务商横向比较：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>度量</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>工程含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>首次修复率 FTF / FPY</td>\n<td>首次上门即通过验收的工单占比</td>\n<td>派工准确性 + 技师能力；多数组织目标 ≥90%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重复上门率</td>\n<td>30 天内同一工单再次上门比例</td>\n<td>返工直接指标，与 BOM 校验质量强相关</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>每千单投诉数</td>\n<td>投诉工单 / 完工工单 × 1000</td>\n<td>归一化后可比</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>每千单安全事件数</td>\n<td>记录在案安全事件 / 总工单 × 1000</td>\n<td>须含未致伤的 near miss</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>平均判定时长</td>\n<td>受理到责任判定完成的小时数</td>\n<td>检验举证窗口是否被有效利用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>根因整改闭环率</td>\n<td>已复检验证的整改 / 全部整改</td>\n<td>防「改了流程但没验」</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一条可自动化执行的质量门是：<strong>安全事件未闭环（根因 + 验证）的片区，不得提高该片区派单上限</strong>，把安全与商业扩张绑定；返工率超阈值的服务商自动进入候选池降权，回落到<a href=\"../appointment-technician-dispatch/technician-matching-routing-dispatch\">技师匹配与路径调度</a>的排序里。赔付协商还有一层约束：美国《冷静期规则》(16 CFR Part 429) 规定在买方住所等非固定场所成交、金额 ≥$25 的销售，消费者享 3 天取消权——上门现场常被用作追加销售场合（升级配件、延保），未告知取消权会额外带来监管处罚。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>上门安装的负面后果按后果类型分三通道：质量投诉、财产损坏、安全事件。三者共用现场证据链，但<strong>时钟与终局完全不同</strong>，必须分模型而非合并成一张表。</li>\n<li>责任判定遵循「<strong>服务方先行担责、除非举证推翻</strong>」，四组证据（进场基线、过程、验收、规范依据）缺一即无法收敛；判定必须有显式举证窗口。</li>\n<li>返工成本是可计量的五元组：人工 + 补件 + 路程 + 安抚 + 罚金；重复上门罚率随上门次数递增，以区分偶发与系统缺陷。</li>\n<li>安全事件处置顺序是「现场隔离 → 法定上报 → 根因整改 → 验证」，<strong>商业赔付不能前置于上报时钟</strong>（OSHA 8h/24h、CPSC 15(b)、EU GPSR 是三个刚性锚点）。</li>\n<li>高空（OSHA 6 英尺）、电气（LOTO）、暖通（ANSI/ACCA 5 QI、ASHRAE 180）等外部规范是判定安装合规的权威依据，内部标准在监管调查中可被推翻。</li>\n<li>度量按「率」定义并设自动化质量门：安全未闭环的片区不得扩量，返工超阈值的服务商自动降权。近失必须计数。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>延伸阅读：服务目录与 eligibility 规则见 <a href=\"../installation-service-catalog/\">第 1 章 服务目录</a>，预约与技师调度见 <a href=\"../appointment-technician-dispatch/\">第 2 章 预约与技师调度</a>，现场执行与证据链见 <a href=\"../field-execution-delivery/\">第 3 章 现场执行</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"安装质量投诉、返工理赔与安全事件闭环","id":"安装质量投诉-返工理赔与安全事件闭环"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：三类事件共用一份证据，却走三条时钟","id":"核心概念-三类事件共用一份证据-却走三条时钟"},{"level":2,"text":"责任归属判定：用举证结构而不是客服话术","id":"责任归属判定-用举证结构而不是客服话术"},{"level":2,"text":"返工理赔的成本计量与扣款模型","id":"返工理赔的成本计量与扣款模型"},{"level":2,"text":"安全事件闭环：法定上报时钟优先于商业处置","id":"安全事件闭环-法定上报时钟优先于商业处置"},{"level":2,"text":"运营度量与闭环质量门","id":"运营度量与闭环质量门"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"完工结算、技师计酬与安装履约度量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-installation-assembly-field-service/completion-aftersales/completion-settlement-pay-kpi"},"next":null}